  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3d1695c02a14ecf4bb127f270293a6cc, type: 3}
  journalLore: 'The wolf the old watch cut into its tally stones before the hearth went cold: grey at the muzzle, and bigger than a wolf has any right to be. Eirik''s grandfather lost men to it. Whatever the mist did to the rest of the pack, it did more to this one, and it has kept the Wolfwood as its own ever since.'
  journalAdvice: 'It hits harder and lasts longer than any of the pack, and it knows a swing is coming before you make it. Parry the bite and strike while it recovers; don''t chase it when it circles off. There is only the one: once it falls, it stays down.'
  journalHabitat: The paths of the Misty Woods and Troll Valley, in packs
  journalKillsToKnow: 3
